    "detailed_description": "CellSar is a sandbox game about collecting cells, building machines and organs out of cells and keeping them alive.<br />\r\n <br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n\u2022 14 Translation Directions: Cells can be connected to each other or moved in 14 directions:  6 perpendicular ones and 8 diagonal ones.<br />\r\n\u2022 Explore: Rich and unique polyhedral cells in a swamp. More than 90 types of cells, each represented by a unique regular-faced polyhedron.<br />\r\n\u2022 Build: Use various cell units to build machines and organs:  muscle cells provide contraction and movement, connective cells provide adhesion, nerve cells support signal transmission, and macrophages kill hostile bacteria.<br />\r\n\u2022 Survival: Collect nutrient and fat cells to feed yourself and other animal cells, keeping them from hunger and disease.",
